note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/plat_policy.om: the Omega port of CUDApp tests/platform_linux_policy.c. Composed after
note gpu/nvidia/om/platform-linux/plat_policy.om and gpu/nvidia/checks/lib.om; run with
note gpu/nvidia/checks/plat_policy.tsv, whose rows the C oracle plat_c wrote for every case of the old test.
note Case: NAME, m[0..15], WANT, q[0..15]. plat_policy m q, with q starting at zero, must return WANT and leave
note exactly q[0..15] in q (the old test's byte compare of the result and the whole reply).
text t_name "PLAT_POLICY"
fn cname to void
for i ulong len t_name bound 64
ckoc ulong get t_name i
end
end
fn crow to bool
if ne ckcnt 34
ckbad
end
m = new ulong 16 0
q = new ulong 16 0
for i ulong 16
put m i cknum add i 1
end
if ne plat_policy m q cknum 17
ret false
end
for i ulong 16
if ne get q i cknum add i 18
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
